        },
        {
          "text": "Ameno to joay wok i got pa Rwoth woth ma ndelo adek gi Kakan ma Cikirok pa Rwoth kareno otelo jo i woth ma ndelo adek no, ma rango rijo kama joywomer'iye.",
          "type": "text",
